idden POU, need POU hide. If simulator can't find, bad. What does `hide` do in application? It likely only matters for libraries; no effect. Fine.\n\nCould include `{attribute 'qualified_only'}` on variable too (recognized) no effect. Already.\n\nLet's call last sim. If passes, good. If fail, maybe no compile but we can still verify. Let's do."},"sequence_number":2175}

